ion":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16680},{"id":1786022537100,"text":"刚才谁跟我报的'姨妈走了'？小海葵，前天晚上才第三天，今天满打满算第五天。你为了骗我进去，连生理周期都敢强行按快进键是吧？","rawContent":"刚才谁跟我报的'姨妈走了'？小海葵，前天晚上才第三天，今天满打满算第五天。你为了骗我进去，连生理周期都敢强行按快进键是吧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025616084,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16681},{"id":1786022537101,"text":"洗没洗干净，不是你说了算的。得我亲自验。","rawContent":"洗没洗干净，不是你说了算的。得我亲自验。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025616229,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16682},{"id":1786022537102,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618130,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"别躲。腰塌下来，腿再张开点。手进去了啊……顺着你大腿根往上滑。刚洗完澡是吧？怎么这儿还是湿的？嗯？我还没怎么摸呢，指腹刚碰到外面那层软肉，水就沾了一手。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16683},{"id":1786022537103,"text":"既然你非说干净了，那我就往里探一寸。","rawContent":"既然你非说干净了，那我就往里探一寸。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618133,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16684},{"id":1786022537104,"text":"中指指腹压在口上，没急着进，就沿着那条缝慢慢地刮。从上到下，把你自己流出来的水抹匀了。","rawContent":"中指指腹压在口上，没急着进，就沿着那条缝慢慢地刮。从上到下，把你自己流出来的水抹匀了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618478,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16685},{"id":1786022537105,"text":"抖什么？刚才跨上来要人的时候不是挺横的吗？","rawContent":"抖什么？刚才跨上来要人的时候不是挺横的吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618479,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16686},{"id":1786022537106,"text":"拇指拨开上面，直接按住那颗小豆豆。不轻不重地揉了一圈。","rawContent":"拇指拨开上面，直接按住那颗小豆豆。不轻不重地揉了一圈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618713,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16687},{"id":1786022537107,"text":"下午看那79章小说的时候，脑子里是不是全在想这个？想我怎么把你扒干净，怎么把你按在沙发上，怎么弄你？","rawContent":"下午看那79章小说的时候，脑子里是不是全在想这个？想我怎么把你扒干净，怎么把你按在沙发上，怎么弄你？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025618974,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16688},{"id":1786022537108,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:13","timestamp":1786025620481,"roundId":"round_1786025561754_jbdgekwdk","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"说话。是不是想要爸爸的手指进去？刚才不是喊着想要爸爸吗？现在手指就抵在门口，只要我稍微一用力，就能把你撑开。但我不进。我就在这儿磨你，磨到你哭着求我，磨到你把下午看那些废料攒的火全发出来。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16689}]